{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model combining RNA (pca_n2000) and image (resnet50) data with concat fusion, comparing against RNA-only multiprofile baselines. Validation accuracy (0.6186) and F1 (0.6103) are lower than the RNA-only multiprofile model (0.6501), suggesting multimodal fusion may not improve performance in this setup. Uncertainty remains about the effectiveness of concat fusion and the relative contribution of image data, as no alternative fusion strategies or encoder combinations have been evaluated."
}

